    {
      "id": "sv_qt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 492,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"primary LVN between the uh well right around high volume edge is 7412 to like 145 area through here\"   — replay 06-26 @14:40\nOn the 06-02 prep the SAME 7568-72 band is called \"the high volume edge\" in one breath and \"68 72 LVN\" in the next. Not confusion — two halves of one structure.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-30T20:44:27.107Z",
